    "body": "## Motivation\n\nIterating a `RandomDataset` for eight requests returns eight entries containing only four distinct request objects and prompts. `RandomIDsDataset` already caches each generated request, and `RandomDataset` appends the same object again after decoding it. This introduces paired duplicate prefixes into random simulator workloads.\n\n## Modifications\n\nRemove the second cache insertion and keep the parent responsible for caching. Add CPU regression coverage through the public dataset factory using the repository's tokenizer assets, covering independent sequential requests, cached rereads, slices, and both text and token-ID modes.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nRebased onto `9fa9308e95`, which contains the required base `ff8d964cf5`. On this source, both dataset-cache regressions pass on CPU; the duplicate-request cache regression fail with the unmodified main production code.\n\n`pre-commit run --all-files` passes, including the Rust formatting and Clippy checks.\n\nValidation covers dataset generation and caching through the public factory. The simulator-server/model-inference test is outside this dataset regression run.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable to this dataset bookkeeping fix. No model inference benchmark was run.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format code with pre-commit.\n- [x] Add focused regression tests in the existing simulator CPU CI test file.\n- [x] Documentation assessed: no interface or configuration change.\n- [x] Accuracy and speed validation assessed: model evaluation and profiling are not applicable; the validation boundary is stated above.\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style guidance.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #38670007038](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38670007038)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38670006971](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38670006971)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
